# Cursor Rules for T81 Foundation

This file is a lightweight Cursor adapter. **Authoritative rules, research continuity boundaries, frozen contracts, and contribution guidelines live in [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md)** — read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ai-context/START_HERE.md` first before making changes.

## Cursor-Specific Workflow Hooks
- Locate the matching contract in `spec/` before editing implementation files (`isa/`, `vm/`, `fs/`, `kernel/axion/`, `lang/`, `src/provider/`, `tools/`).
- Preserve frozen boundaries (`TISC v1.9.0`, `docs/governance/PUBLIC_API_LOCK.json`, `include/t81/**/*.hpp`) and all active research holds (`F01 M1–M6 STOP`, `SCG-08 Gate 2 NO-GO`, `H01` / Inv 10A `BLOCKED`, `AXION-AI-001 HD01–HD06`).
- Prefer small, reviewable C++20/Python increments with matching unit tests (`tests/cpp/`, `tests/vm/`, `tests/ci/`) and local governance verification before opening a PR.
- Keep public claims evidence-bounded; never fabricate benchmarks, citations, or test runs.
